Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The original needles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,were autoclaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,what is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,an autoclave?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And they look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,at me like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,deer caught in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the headlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it was a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,technique to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,sterilize needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So we used
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,was painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that technology
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,has improved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,dramatically over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,literally almost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,like acupuncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We use these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.81,0:00:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,special needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're microphones,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,essentially.
